``` PHP or Web Server Process Spawns Shell, Interpreter or Download Tool (php2shell post-exploitation) ```
``` Sigma id: 120e77fd-91e2-4cdd-ba44-6f2b5fad42c4 | level: high | status: experimental ```
``` Target: Splunk SPL - CIM Endpoint data model (tstats); needs CIM-mapped EDR/Sysmon data ```
``` Generated by tools/build_rules.py - UNTESTED, review field names before use. ```
| tstats summariesonly=false allow_old_summaries=true fillnull_value="null" count min(_time) as firstTime max(_time) as lastTime from datamodel=Endpoint.Processes where Processes.parent_process_path IN ("*php-fpm*", "*php-cgi*", "*lsphp*") OR Processes.parent_process_path IN ("*httpd", "*apache2") Processes.process_path IN ("*/sh", "*/bash", "*/dash", "*/zsh", "*/ksh", "*/ash", "*/busybox", "*/python", "*/python2", "*/python3", "*/perl", "*/ruby", "*/nc", "*/ncat", "*/netcat", "*/socat", "*/curl", "*/wget", "*/telnet", "*/openssl", "*/base64", "*/whoami", "*/id", "*/uname", "*/hostname", "*/ifconfig", "*/crontab", "*/mkfifo", "*/nohup") NOT (Processes.process IN ("*sendmail*", "*postdrop*", "*exim*", "*msmtp*")) by Processes.process Processes.dest Processes.process_current_directory Processes.process_path Processes.process_integrity_level Processes.original_file_name Processes.parent_process Processes.parent_process_path Processes.parent_process_guid Processes.parent_process_id Processes.process_guid Processes.process_id Processes.user | `drop_dm_object_name(Processes)` | convert timeformat="%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%S" ctime(firstTime) | convert timeformat="%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%S" ctime(lastTime) 
